 d['access']=dict(supported='Use short choices, named evidence cards and a sentence bank. Accept pointing followed by one spoken reason.',standard='Classify four cases and write an evidence-based repair label explaining new substances.',stretch='Evaluate a misleading irreversible-change rule and explain an open-system mass observation qualitatively.',regulation='Use fictional workshop cases. Offer private responses, drawing or scribing; pupils may pass and return to a shared question. No sensory smoke or flame exposure is part of the task.')
